Small branching map: intervention -> shared Schwann differentiation/myelin program -> Pmp22; intervention -> gene-selective transcription or RNA fate -> Pmp22; intervention -> cell/RNA composition -> apparent bulk selectivity; intervention -> proliferation/stress -> both target and comparison genes; measurement/detection/normalization -> apparent selectivity. Purified/cultured populations reduce one composition ambiguity but do not clamp state. RNA responses do not choose transcription versus decay. Independent same-context studies can test reproducibility; different ages/species/compartments test transfer, not isolate its cause.

Before new acquisition/outcome inspection, plan to screen accessible full processed transcriptomes across injury, differentiation/growth factor, inflammation and metabolism/drugs; reserve substantial work for independent validation and source-paper/novelty audit rather than maximizing screened datasets. Rank by robust target-minus-program effect, biological replication and compartment eligibility, not Pmp22 p-values alone. Freeze the leading prediction after discovery and before inspecting an independent eligible matrix. No claim that public data or model knowledge are blinded.

